{"book": "textbook", "page": 62, "width": 1171, "height": 1595, "rows": [{"text": "我晚上六点半下班|Lesson", "confidence": 0.97452, "box": [[0.70965, 0.0395], [0.88471, 0.04075], [0.88386, 0.05705], [0.70965, 0.0558]]}, {"text": "小语讲堂", "confidence": 0.99496, "box": [[0.22459, 0.09718], [0.3655, 0.09906], [0.3655, 0.12727], [0.22374, 0.12539]]}, {"text": "Xiaoyu's Classroom", "confidence": 0.99564, "box": [[0.37062, 0.10533], [0.56191, 0.10721], [0.56191, 0.12539], [0.37062, 0.12414]]}, {"text": "时间的表达（2）Expression of Time(2)", "confidence": 0.97253, "box": [[0.18531, 0.15298], [0.51751, 0.15423], [0.51751, 0.17304], [0.18531, 0.17179]]}, {"text": "（1）使用“点、分”表达时间点Using“点”and“分”to express specific times", "confidence": 0.96866, "box": [[0.19556, 0.18307], [0.82067, 0.18495], [0.82067, 0.20313], [0.19471, 0.20125]]}, {"text": "“点、分”表示具体时间点，整点使用“点”，不是整点使用“分”，“分”可", "confidence": 0.99818, "box": [[0.23484, 0.20564], [0.90777, 0.20627], [0.90777, 0.22508], [0.23484, 0.22445]]}, {"text": "以省略。但是，当时间为“十分”时，不能省略“分”；当时间为十分以下时，要读", "confidence": 0.99857, "box": [[0.18873, 0.22947], [0.90777, 0.23009], [0.90777, 0.24702], [0.18873, 0.24639]]}, {"text": "出“零”", "confidence": 0.98892, "box": [[0.18873, 0.25329], [0.269, 0.25329], [0.269, 0.26834], [0.18873, 0.26834]]}, {"text": "The words “点”and “分”are used to indicate specific points in time.“点” is used for", "confidence": 0.97297, "box": [[0.22459, 0.27524], [0.90777, 0.27586], [0.90777, 0.29279], [0.22459, 0.29216]]}, {"text": "whole hours,while “分”is used when minutes are involved. The word “分”can be omitted.", "confidence": 0.94855, "box": [[0.18787, 0.29718], [0.90692, 0.29906], [0.90692, 0.31473], [0.18787, 0.31348]]}, {"text": "However, when the time is exactly ten minutes,“分” cannot be omitted.For times less than ten", "confidence": 0.96717, "box": [[0.18702, 0.32038], [0.90863, 0.321], [0.90863, 0.3373], [0.18702, 0.33668]]}, {"text": "minutes,“零”must bepronounced.", "confidence": 0.96491, "box": [[0.18787, 0.34483], [0.45517, 0.34483], [0.45517, 0.35925], [0.18787, 0.35925]]}, {"text": "大声朗读。Readaloud.", "confidence": 0.99236, "box": [[0.20666, 0.37179], [0.3971, 0.37179], [0.3971, 0.38809], [0.20666, 0.38809]]}, {"text": "点", "confidence": 0.99997, "box": [[0.29547, 0.40439], [0.32365, 0.40439], [0.32365, 0.42382], [0.29547, 0.42382]]}, {"text": "分", "confidence": 0.99998, "box": [[0.4526, 0.40502], [0.47908, 0.40502], [0.47908, 0.42508], [0.4526, 0.42508]]}, {"text": "数字写法（numericalnotation）", "confidence": 0.99919, "box": [[0.5807, 0.40502], [0.84287, 0.40627], [0.84287, 0.42445], [0.57985, 0.4232]]}, {"text": "九点", "confidence": 0.99977, "box": [[0.28437, 0.44138], [0.33476, 0.44138], [0.33476, 0.46207], [0.28437, 0.46207]]}, {"text": "9:00", "confidence": 0.98459, "box": [[0.69257, 0.44326], [0.73954, 0.44326], [0.73954, 0.46144], [0.69257, 0.46144]]}, {"text": "二十点", "confidence": 0.99982, "box": [[0.27498, 0.46708], [0.34415, 0.46708], [0.34415, 0.48715], [0.27498, 0.48715]]}, {"text": "20:00", "confidence": 0.99792, "box": [[0.68745, 0.46897], [0.74381, 0.46897], [0.74381, 0.48652], [0.68745, 0.48652]]}, {"text": "十五点", "confidence": 0.99981, "box": [[0.27242, 0.49028], [0.345, 0.49216], [0.34415, 0.51411], [0.27156, 0.51223]]}, {"text": "四十", "confidence": 0.99989, "box": [[0.4415, 0.49091], [0.49018, 0.49279], [0.48847, 0.51348], [0.44065, 0.5116]]}, {"text": "15:40", "confidence": 0.99424, "box": [[0.68745, 0.49404], [0.74381, 0.49404], [0.74381, 0.51097], [0.68745, 0.51097]]}, {"text": "二十一点", "confidence": 0.99987, "box": [[0.26558, 0.51724], [0.35354, 0.51724], [0.35354, 0.53668], [0.26558, 0.53668]]}, {"text": "十分", "confidence": 0.99993, "box": [[0.4398, 0.51661], [0.49103, 0.51661], [0.49103, 0.53793], [0.4398, 0.53793]]}, {"text": "21:10", "confidence": 0.99105, "box": [[0.68745, 0.5185], [0.74381, 0.5185], [0.74381, 0.53668], [0.68745, 0.53668]]}, {"text": "二十二点", "confidence": 0.99997, "box": [[0.26302, 0.54169], [0.3544, 0.54295], [0.35354, 0.56238], [0.26217, 0.561